---
layout: default
---
<div class="home">
  <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <div class="home-hero__copy">
      <h1 id="home-title">I build AI systems that ship.</h1>
      <p class="home-deck">
        Founder and fractional CTO in Brooklyn. I work with early-stage startups on architecture, AI integration, and the systems that keep product
        teams moving.
      </p>
      <p class="home-links">
        <a href="https://calendly.com/chuck-blake/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a call →</a>
        <a href="https://ingeneral.substack.com/">Read In General →</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    {% if page.profile.image %}
      <div class="home-hero__portrait">
        {% assign profile_image_path = page.profile.image | prepend: 'assets/img/' %}
        {% include figure.liquid loading="eager" path=profile_image_path sizes="168px" alt="Chuck Blake" cache_bust=true %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section class="home-now" aria-labelledby="home-now-title">
    <h2 id="home-now-title">Now</h2>
    <a class="home-row" href="https://glnc.io">
      <span class="home-row__name">Glance</span>
      <span class="home-row__desc">Expectation monitoring for automated work</span>
    </a>
    <a class="home-row" href="https://ingeneral.substack.com/">
      <span class="home-row__name">In General</span>
      <span class="home-row__desc">My newsletter on tools, workflows, and AI in practice</span>
    </a>
    <a class="home-row" href="{{ '/music/' | relative_url }}">
      <span class="home-row__name">Corvoco</span>
      <span class="home-row__desc">Chill post-punk electronic music, plus every show I go to</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</div>
